    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "p1a_t",
      "x": 84,
      "y": 834,
      "width": 384,
      "height": 44,
      "text": "ACCOUNT-BASED\nMicrosoft.CognitiveServices/accounts (kind AIServices)",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "p1a_b",
      "x": 84,
      "y": 886,
      "width": 388,
      "height": 159,
      "text": "+ Allowed types: accounts + Storage + Insights\n   whitelist por TIPO ja barra GPU / Search / ML\n+ Deny deployment SKU != Standard (mata PTU)\n+ Deny model FW-* / Sora\n+ Deny kind != AIServices / OpenAI\n\nLimpo: da pra separar Foundry de GPU\nso pelo tipo de recurso.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "p1b",
      "x": 510,
      "y": 826,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 344,
      "strokeColor": "#f7630c",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff4ce",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "p1b_t",
      "x": 524,
      "y": 834,
      "width": 394,
      "height": 44,
      "text": "HUB-BASED\nMicrosoft.MachineLearningServices/workspaces",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "p1b_b",
      "x": 524,
      "y": 886,
      "width": 398,
      "height": 159,
      "text": "! MESMO tipo hospeda GPU compute\n   nao da pra separar so pelo tipo\n+ Deny compute vmSize GPU (NC / ND / NV)\n+ Deny online / serverless endpoints GPU\n+ Deny Microsoft.SaaS (marketplace MaaS)\n+ Allowed types: workspaces + Storage +\n   KeyVault + ACR + Insights\n+ Deny SKU na conta AOAI conectada",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "p2",
      "x": 970,
