    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "p3_t",
      "x": 1606,
      "y": 780,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 57,
      "text": "$500 e matematico,\nnao esperanca",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "p3_b",
      "x": 1606,
      "y": 854,
      "width": 312,
      "height": 255,
      "text": "Sem meter de relogio (Camada 1):\n  burn = TPM_cap x preco_token\n\nGateway quota = teto de $ / periodo\nEstourou  ->  403\nNao espera Cost Mgmt (8-24h)\n\nSLO de overshoot:\n  burn_max x latencia_deteccao\n  <= overshoot aceitavel\n\nProve com GameDay: estoura um\nRG de teste e cronometra.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
